{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sji5snel","slide":3,"text":"MY_SLOT_START_US = SYNC_BUFFER_US + (seq - 1) * SLOT_INTERVAL_US\n\n32sym N2 기준:\nMY_SLOT_START_US = 3000 + (2 - 1) * 717 = 3717 us\n\nRX_ON 예약:\nslot_offset_us = 3000 + 1 * 717 - RX_EARLY_US\nRX_EARLY_US = PREAMBLE_US + SFD_US + lead","textPreview":"MY_SLOT_START_US = SYNC_BUFFER_US + (seq - 1) * SLOT_INTERVAL_US |  | 32sym N2 기준: | MY_SLOT_START_US = 3000 + (2 - 1) * 717 = 3717 us | ...","textChars":227,"textLines":8,"bbox":[96,238,488,260]}
